---
title: "S-IMPL-01 — Login (SesiController, MasukRequest)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Pengguna (Admin/Anggota)
    participant V as Vue 3 + Inertia<br/>Pages/Auth/Login.vue
    participant R as MasukRequest<br/>(validasi + RateLimiter)
    participant C as SesiController
    participant O as Eloquent<br/>User
    participant DB as MySQL 8.4
    P->>V: Isi identitas pengguna & kata sandi, klik Masuk
    V->>C: POST /login (header XSRF-TOKEN, middleware guest)
    C->>R: autentikasi()
    R->>R: Cek batas 5 percobaan / 60 detik
    Note over V,R: Galat validasi = ValidationException → redirect back + errors di sesi (Inertia)
    R->>O: where(username)->first()
    O->>DB: SELECT … FROM users WHERE username = ?
    DB-->>O: baris akun / kosong
    alt Akun tidak ada atau kata sandi salah
        R->>R: Hash::check (hash pengecoh bila akun tidak ada), RateLimiter::hit
        R-->>V: galat validasi — pesan gagal generik
    else Akun / anggota nonaktif
        R-->>V: galat validasi — pesan alasan tolak masuk
    else Kredensial valid
        R->>R: RateLimiter::clear
        R-->>C: User
        C->>DB: Auth::login + session()->regenerate() (tabel sessions)
        C-->>V: 302 ke dashboard sesuai peran
    Note over V,C: Middleware wajib.ganti.sandi mengalihkan Anggota<br/>dengan must_change_password = 1 ke /anggota/kata-sandi
        V->>C: GET /admin/dashboard atau /anggota/dashboard (auth, peran:*)
        C->>DB: Agregasi SQL ringkasan (COUNT / SUM kondisional / GROUP BY)
        C-->>V: Respons Inertia (props) → render dashboard
    end
